an> · <span>2026-05-23</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Desktop app for cross-agent AI handoffs\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/kavishsathia/inline\" target=\"_blank\">inline</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Inline comments from an AI coding agent to your IDE. Designed for developers who prefer IDE integration over terminal-based AI coding agents or desktop apps.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">IDE integration</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-06-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"For those who can't read off a terminal\"</div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <h2>Whitelist Updates <span class=\"section-count\">11</span></h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.163\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.163</span> Enterprise Version Management\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Added version management controls for enterprise deployments, enhanced plugin management with /plugin list command supporting filters, improved /btw with clipboard copy shortcut, and enhanced hooks capabilities.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-06-04</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.162\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.162</span> Enhanced Agent CLI\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Enhanced claude agents --json with waitingFor field showing session blockers, improved tool specification for Grep/Glob on native builds, added /effort persistence confirmation, and enhanced slash command autocomplete behavior.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-06-03</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.161\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.161</span> OpenTelemetry Integration\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        OpenTelemetry integration with custom label support via OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES, improved claude agents UI with progress indicators, enhanced /mcp connector management, and improved parallel tool call error handling.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-06-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.160\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.160</span> Safety Prompts\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Added safety prompts before writing to shell startup files and git config, enhanced acceptEdits mode to prompt before build-tool config writes, improved Edit tool behavior after grep operations.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-06-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.158\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.158</span> Auto Mode Expansion\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Extended Auto mode support to Bedrock, Vertex, and Foundry platforms for Opus 4.7 and 4.8 models via CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_AUTO_MODE=1 environment variable.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-05-30</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.157\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.157</span> Automatic Plugin Loading\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Automatic plugin loading from .claude/skills directories, added claude plugin init scaffolding command, enhanced plugin autocomplete, improved claude agents with settings.json support, and enhanced EnterWorktree switching capabilities.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-05-29</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.156\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.156</span> Critical Opus Fix\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Fixed critical issue with Opus 4.8 where thinking blocks were being modified, causing API errors.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">bugfix</span>\n                        <span>2026-05-29</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.154\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.154</span> Opus 4.8 Launch\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Introduced Opus 4.8 with high-effort default (/effort xhigh), launched dynamic workflows orchestrating tens to hundreds of background agents, reduced Fast mode cost to 2x standard rate for 2.5x speed.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">release</span>\n                        <span>2026-05-28</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.153\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.153</span> Plugin Sources & Diagnostics\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Added skipLfs option for GitHub/git plugin sources, added npm global install auto-update notice with /doctor diagnostics, enhanced status line commands with terminal size environment variables.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-05-28</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.152\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.152</span> Enhanced Code Review\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Enhanced /code-review --fix to apply findings and renamed /simplify to /code-review, added disallowed-tools frontmatter for skills/slash commands, added /reload-skills command.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-05-27</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.149\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.149</span> Usage Analytics\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Enhanced /usage with per-category breakdown (skills, subagents, plugins, MCP servers), improved /diff detail view with keyboard scrolling, added GFM task list checkbox rendering.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-05-22</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n                <h2>Technical Insights <span class=\"section-count\">3</span></h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.brethorsting.com/blog/2026/05/domain-expertise-has-always-been-the-real-moat/\" target=\"_blank\">Domain expertise has always been the real moat</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Discussion on how domain expertise remains critical even with AI advances. The conversation touches on how AI coding tools and LLMs change (but don't eliminate) the value of deep technical knowledge.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        Aaron Brethorst · <span>2026-05-30</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI coding</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">domain expertise</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">developer skills</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://openrouter.ai/announcements/series-b\" target=\"_blank\">OpenRouter raises $113M Series B</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        OpenRouter, an AI model routing platform, raised $113M in Series B funding. This highlights continued investment in AI infrastructure and developer tooling for accessing multiple LLM APIs through unified interfaces.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        OpenRouter Team · <span>2026-05-30</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI infrastructure</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM routing</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">funding</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://claude.ai/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Opus 4.8 Launch and Dynamic Workflows</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Anthropic released Claude Opus 4.8 with improved performance and accuracy. Introduced dynamic workflows that adapt to task complexity. Enhanced terminal interaction with better command suggestions and multi-step execution support.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        Anthropic · <span>2026-05-29</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI coding</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">agentic workflows</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <a href=\"#\">Archives</a> |\n            <a href=\"#\">About</a> |\n            <a href=\"#\">RSS Feed</a> |\n            <a href=\"#\">GitHub</a>\n            <br><br>\n            Generated with ❤️ for the agentic coding community\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
