    "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-06-05</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n            padding: 0;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 10px;\n        }\n\n        header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 5px 10px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n\n        header h1 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        header .date {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-top: 3px;\n        }\n\n        .three-column-layout {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 40% 35% 25%;\n            gap: 15px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1200px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            }\n            .technical-insights {\n                grid-column: 1 / -1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n            .technical-insights {\n                grid-column: 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        section {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            padding: 10px;\n        }\n\n        section h2 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            padding-bottom: 8px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        .item {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            padding-bottom: 12px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dotted #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .item:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            padding-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            font-size: 13px;\n            font-weight: normal;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:visited {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .item-description {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta a {\n            color: #828282;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .category {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .version-badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            color: #000000;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .update-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            color: #828282;\n            margin-left: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .quote {\n            font-style: italic;\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            margin-top: 3px;\n        }\n\n        .topics {\n            margin-top: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .topic {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #828282;\n            padding: 2px 5px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            margin-right: 4px;\n            border-radius: 3px;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 20px 10px;\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n\n        footer a {\n            color: #828282;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        footer a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .section-count {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            color: #000000;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-left: 8px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        code {\n            font-family: Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 1px 4px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            section {\n                break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n\n            .three-column-layout {\n                display: block;\n            }\n\n            section {\n                margin-bottom: 20px;\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n            <h1>Agentic Coding Research Report</h1>\n            <div class=\"date\">June 5, 2026</div>\n        </header>\n\n        <main class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <!-- New Products Section -->\n            <section class=\"new-products\">\n                <h2>New Products <span class=\"section-count\">15</span></h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/manan45/Cantus\" target=\"_blank\">Cantus</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        A Claude-first, local-first desktop coding environment for macOS (Apple Silicon). A native Tauri 2 app that pairs a Monaco editor with an integrated terminal running the Claude Code CLI.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">AI IDE</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-05-28</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"The open-source IDE and GUI for Claude Code on macOS\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/tmdgusya/roach-code\" target=\"_blank\">roach-code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        A config- and plugin-driven terminal AI coding agent supporting multiple models (DeepSeek, Codex/OpenAI, MiniMax, GLM). A multi-model rewrite distributed as a single static Go binary.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-06-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Multi-model & composable - any OpenAI-compatible endpoint is a config entry\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/KangarooKi/Ultracode\" target=\"_blank\">Ultracode</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        A local AI-assisted coding CLI inspired by Claude Code. Runs agentic coding workflows in your workspace with OpenAI-compatible models, function-calling tools, task planning, memory, and permissions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-05-31</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Terminal-first coding agent for developers\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/tathagat22/plumb-mcp\" target=\"_blank\">plumb-mcp</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        A local Figma MCP server with no REST rate limits, no metered tool-call quotas, and a verification loop. A drop-in alternative to Figma's Dev Mode MCP.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">MCP server</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-05-23</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Works on every plan including Free\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/ntd4996/agentpet\" target=\"_blank\">agentpet</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        A native macOS menu bar app with a desktop pet that monitors your AI coding agents (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI) in real time. Provides visual feedback and monitoring for terminal-based AI coding workflows.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">Desktop monitoring</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-05-31</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"A desktop pet that monitors your AI coding agents in real time\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/XWJDream/MimoAgent\" target=\"_blank\">MimoAgent</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        AI-powered coding assistant desktop app based on Xiaomi MiMo. Supports code generation, debugging, refactoring, project analysis, MCP tools, and TTS.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">Desktop AI</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-05-30</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Comprehensive AI coding assistance in a desktop app\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/Daaaaave/agentic-workspace-core\" target=\"_blank\">agentic-workspace-core</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        A portable repository-native foundation for agent memory, skills, handoffs, and knowledge workflows. Provides project-long memory and workspace management across AI coding sessions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">Memory framework</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-05-23</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Knowledge workflows for AI agents\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/68110923/rx-gui\" target=\"_blank\">rx-gui (Reasonix)</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        JetBrains IDE AI Coding Assistant plugin featuring DeepSeek AI integration. Supports streaming conversations, Markdown rendering, code diff review, and cost tracking.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">JetBrains plugin</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-05-24</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"JetBrains IDE AI Coding Assistant with DeepSeek AI\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/vikingmute/review-forge\" target=\"_blank\">review-forge</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        An Agent Skill for structured, auditable code review workflows. Provides workflow-specific code review capabilities for AI coding agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">Code review</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-05-29</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Structured, auditable code review workflows\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/sigmashakeinc/vscode\" target=\"_blank\">SigmaShake SSG</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        VS Code extension for AI governance, guardrails, audit, and .rules language support. Provides oversight and policy enforcement for Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini, and MCP assistants.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">VS Code extension</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-05-25</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"AI governance, guardrails, audit & .rules language support\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/m-aboud/openclaw-devops-copilot\" target=\"_blank\">openclaw-devops-copilot</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        DevOps Copilot: an AI-powered assistant for DevOps workflows, infrastructure as code generation, and SRE tasks. Helps orchestrate complex development operations workflows.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">DevOps agent</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-06-01</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"AI-powered assistant for DevOps workflows\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/MagWizD/alethia-clients\" target=\"_blank\">alethia-clients</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        VSCode extension and JetBrains plugin for Aletheia that passively detects and attributes AI-generated code contributions by serializing flagged metadata as git notes on each commit.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">AI attribution</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-05-25</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Passively detects and attributes AI-generated code contributions\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/uuhan/ai.nvim\" target=\"_blank\">ai.nvim</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        A Neovim plugin for AI agent integration. Provides AI capabilities directly within the Neovim editor environment.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">Neovim plugin</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-06-04</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Your final AI plugin for Neovim\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/kzoldyk/baton\" target=\"_blank\">baton</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Desktop app for cross-agent AI handoffs. Pass project context, git diffs, and task states seamlessly between Codex, Claude Code, Gemini CLI, and other AI coding agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">Agent orchestration</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</